Package: ros-app-defaults
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: ros-fonts (= @VERSION@)
Maintainer: ROS Project <yvesm189@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/yvesm189/ros
Description: ROS defaults for catalogue applications
 Configuration that makes the applications in the ROS catalogue behave like
 part of ROS rather than like their upstreams: the brand font inside documents
 and web pages, telemetry off, and no first-run or upsell prompts.
 .
 The files are inert until the application they configure is installed, so this
 package is safe on a workstation that has none of them.
